Package: fastsasconvert
Title: Convert SAS7BDAT Files to Parquet Without Loading Them
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tobias", "Kragholm", , "tkragholm@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts .sas7bdat files to Parquet, CSV or TSV, one file or a
    directory tree at a time, mirroring the input tree into an output root.
    Conversion happens entirely in Rust: the data never enters the R session, so
    files far larger than available memory can be converted. Companion to the
    'fastsas' package, which reads SAS files into R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
